  "body": "Introducing 11 The Terrace, Takapuna - a boutique collection of only six architecturally designed freehold residences, created for those who appreciate refined design, premium craftsmanship, and an unbeatable coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nRarely does a development of this calibre become available in such a tightly held central Takapuna location.\r\n\r\nPositioned on one of Takapuna's most desirable streets, these brand-new residences combine bold contemporary architecture with carefully curated interiors that stand confidently apart from the ordinary. From striking colour palettes to artistic bathroom detailing, every home has been thoughtfully designed to bring personality, warmth, and sophistication into everyday living.\r\n\r\nSpanning three beautifully appointed levels, each residence offers an intelligent and highly functional layout:\r\n\r\n* Ground floor single garage and a lounge or can be used as ensuite bedroom - ideal for guests, extended family, or a private work-from-home setup\r\n* Expansive open-plan living, dining, and designer kitchen on the middle level\r\n* Two luxurious master suites upstairs, including selected homes with captivating sea views\r\n* Internal access garaging and excellent storage throughout\r\n* Optional lift installation available (quotation upon request)\r\n\r\nAt the centre of the home, the designer kitchens are crafted to impress, featuring premium Miele appliances, integrated fridge solutions, and refined cabinetry seamlessly blended into the architectural aesthetic. Clean lines, high-end finishes, and exceptional attention to detail create a level of sophistication rarely seen in today's townhouse market.\r\n\r\nUnlike many new developments, 11 The Terrace offers the freedom and convenience of freehold titles with no body corporate fees - a truly rare opportunity in central Takapuna.\r\n\r\nLocated just moments from Takapuna Beach, Shore City Shopping Centre, vibrant cafés, award-winning restaurants, and everyday amenities, the lifestyle on offer here is second to none. Enjoy the perfect balance of coastal relaxation and urban convenience, all within easy reach of Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nBuilt for long-term peace of mind, every residence is backed by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee.\r\n\r\nBoutique developments of this scale, quality, and location are becoming increasingly hard to find.\r\n\r\nThis is more than a home.\r\nThis is statement living.\r\nThis is Takapuna at its finest.",
